# One Last Job's creature mode (+{2}) takes any creature card, so Bulwark Ox, a Mount, qualifies, while Passenger Ferry, a Vehicle
# card that is no creature in a graveyard (CR 301.7), is refused at that slot (CR 205.2a, 115.1). The Mount-or-Vehicle mode (+{1})
# refuses Savannah Lions, a creature card that is neither. Modes 1 and 2 cost {2}{W} + {2} + {1} = six mana, paid exactly by Black
# Lotus (three white) and three Moxen. The Lions stay in the graveyard, the Ox and the Ferry enter untapped, in printed order.

